      {
         "id": "SECTION_rules",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### How to play\n\nThe game has three levels. In each level, you will see an equation with empty spaces. Complete it using the arrows under each empty space. The exercise is complete when both sides of the equation are equal.\n\n- **Level 1**: practices the addition identity. The left side shows <b>a + 0</b>. Use the arrows to place the value <b>a</b> on the right side.\n- **Level 2**: practices the commutative axiom. The left side shows <b>a + b</b>. One value on the right side is already filled in. Use the arrows to complete the missing value.\n- **Level 3**: practices the commutative axiom again. The left side shows <b>a + b</b>. Use the arrows to place both values on the right side.\n\nYou can learn about these axioms in the previous texts (<htcite0>; <htcite1>).",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "7a9c733b-ca13-40f5-8849-19012540b028",
                     "text": "Ernst, Dana.",
                     "page": "",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2014",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  }
               ],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_game",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "<p><center><div class=\"compGame\"><p id=\"axLevelTitle\" class=\"compLevel\"></p><p id=\"axInstr\" class=\"compInstr\"></p><div id=\"axTable\"></div><div class=\"compFeedback\"><p id=\"axMsgCorrect\" class=\"compMsg compMsgCorrect\" style=\"display: none;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\"></i> Correct!</p><p id=\"axMsgLevelComplete\" class=\"compMsg compMsgFinish\" style=\"display: none;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-medal\"></i> Level complete!</p><p id=\"axMsgGameComplete\" class=\"compMsg compMsgFinish\" style=\"display: none;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-medal\"></i> Game complete! Congratulations!</p></div><p id=\"axProgress\" class=\"compProgress\"></p><p id=\"axScoreText\" class=\"compScore\"></p><p><button type=\"button\" id=\"axNext\" class=\"compNext\" style=\"display: none;\"></button> <button type=\"button\" id=\"axRestart\" class=\"compNext\"></button></p><div style=\"display: none;\"><span id=\"axWordLevel\">Level</span><span id=\"axWordExercise\">Exercise</span><span id=\"axWordOf\">of</span><span id=\"axWordScore\">Score</span><span id=\"axWordEquation\">Equation</span><span id=\"axWordArrows\">Arrows</span><span id=\"axWordNextLevel\">Next level</span><span id=\"axWordRestart\">Restart</span><span id=\"axWordPlayAgain\">Play again</span><span id=\"axWordLevel1\">a + 0 = a</span><span id=\"axWordLevel2\">a + b = b + a (Part 1)</span><span id=\"axWordLevel3\">a + b = b + a (Part 2)</span><span id=\"axWordInstr1\">Use the arrows to set the value on the right to make both sides of the equation equal.</span><span id=\"axWordInstr2\">Use the arrows to fill in the missing value on the right to make both sides equal.</span><span id=\"axWordInstr3\">Use the arrows to fill in both values on the right to make both sides equal.</span></div></div></center></p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
