               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\">You can learn about the addition identity in <i>Walking Among the Numbers</i> (<htcite0>), and about the commutative axiom in <i>The Order of Addition</i> (<htcite1>).</p>",
